 "description": "Podcast Rampa\" is an informative show focused on young urban and underrepresented sports such as skateboarding, snowboarding, wakeboarding, cycling, rollerblading, scootering, and similar sports. The podcast will encompass all subcultural aspects of these sports, including the athletes themselves, shop owners, organizers of major international competitions, Olympic athletes, and legal entities working to improve the necessary sports facilities to advance the sports structure. It aims to introduce Croatia and the broader Balkan region to these sports, providing children and young people with adequate conditions for developing new skills and giving them a voice in the media.",
